; LowRider Klipper Simple v0.2 - maximum segment 10 mm
; Initial positioning from unknown machine location is not segmented.
; Preserves existing work zero. Router ON/OFF is MANUAL.
; Requires Mainsail PAUSE_BASE and RESUME. No automatic homing or probing.
; Operation 1 bounds mm: X 50..50 Y 50..50 Z -12..15
; Operation 2 bounds mm: X 46.588..53.412 Y 46.588..53.412 Z -10..15
; Operation 3 bounds mm: X 250..250 Y 350..350 Z -12..15
; Operation 4 bounds mm: X 246.587..253.413 Y 346.587..353.413 Z -10..15
; Operation 5 bounds mm: X 250..250 Y 50..50 Z -12..15
; Operation 6 bounds mm: X 246.587..253.413 Y 46.587..53.413 Z -10..15
; Operation 7 bounds mm: X 50..50 Y 350..350 Z -12..15
; Operation 8 bounds mm: X 46.588..53.412 Y 346.588..353.412 Z -10..15
G90
G21
M220 S100
M400
RESPOND MSG="Tool: 1/8 single flute upcut - 15 mm minimum cutting length. Check work zero and clearance. Router 15700 RPM. Set dial using RPM table, turn ON, then Resume."
PAUSE_BASE
